# A fresh card: no games and nothing played, so home shows the four items
# that always show (SD card, NOR, Settings, Info), each once (T26: fewer
# than five, nearest first: the front, one each side and the next one to
# the right). RIGHT turns to NOR: Info leaves at the left and comes in again
# at the right (every frame hashed).
#! sd-rm Hello.gba
#! sd-rm Games
#! sd-rm Long
#! sd-rm SAVER
-w "nav: home ready"
-s @1:screen.png
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-H @8:@20
-w "home: facing nor"
-s @1:nor.png
